Update the status of {{.FocusedSpec}} to "{{.State}}" by calling POST /api/specs/transition with the matching action (dispatch, undispatch, archive, unarchive, validate, stale, unstale, dismiss-stale, force-complete, migrate); the server validates the edge against the lifecycle state machine, runs stale fan-out, and commits. Valid status values are: vague, drafted, validated, testing, complete, stale, archived. Note that testing and complete are entered by the server drift pipeline (or the force-complete action), never by a frontmatter edit. Also update the corresponding entry in specs/README.md to reflect the new status.